# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# This proxies /api/* requests to your Cloudflare Worker
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Deploy the Worker first (see DEPLOYMENT.md)
# 2. Replace YOUR_WORKER_URL below with your actual Worker URL
#    Example: https://streamfetch-worker.myaccount.workers.dev
# 3. Rebuild and redeploy the frontend
#
# Format: /from /to status_code
# The :splat captures everything after /api/

/api/*  https://YOUR_WORKER_URL.workers.dev/api/:splat  200
